sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as Sensor
  participant L as Event Ledger
  participant W as World State Agent
  participant R as Resident Agent
  participant M as Memory
  participant P as Policy Gateway

  S->>L: sensor event + evidence ref
  L->>W: normalized event + current snapshot
  W->>W: known / unknown / abnormal / observability
  alt 資料不足且值得詢問
    W->>P: request low-intrusion prompt
    P->>R: approved speak action
    R-->>P: resident reply window
    R->>M: confirmed fact / preference / reminder
  else 已足夠或不值得打擾
    W->>M: state update / event memory
  end
